# Captured EXTERNAL evidence (upstream maintainer scripts, tool transcripts, review
# evidence) is committed byte for byte so that it can be compared with its source.
# Its trailing whitespace and final blank lines are part of that record, so git's
# whitespace checks (git diff --check) do not apply to it. cham3-authored files are
# checked normally.
docs/research/evidence/** -whitespace
docs/evidence/** -whitespace
